<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">14042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A second Western security contractor has stepped forward to document Israeli soldiers firing on Palestinians at a Gaza food distribution site.</s> <s>David McIntosh says the shootings weren't exceptional — they were routine, happening at a site where private security firms provide a veneer of humanitarian order while the military controls access and the violence.</s> <s>Neither the security company nor the aid operator has responded, and no investigation is underway.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistani warplanes have quietly landed at Saudi air bases under a mutual defense pact that parliament never reviewed.</s> <s>Islamabad is simultaneously hosting mediation talks for the very war its secret treaty partner has a direct stake in — a contradiction that collapses the moment Riyadh invokes the pact's combat clauses.</s> <s>If that happens, Pakistan shifts from mediator to belligerent, and its leverage with Tehran disappears overnight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Wang Yi flew to Pyongyang this week — China's foreign minister activating the North Korea alliance before May's Trump-Xi summit.</s> <s>The timing isn't subtle: Washington's stretched across Iran and trade negotiations, and Beijing's reminding everyone it holds a card the US can't match.</s> <s>Whether Kim Jong-un demands sanctions relief in exchange for restraint will set the ceiling on what Beijing can offer Trump at the table.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A second South African cabinet minister has been caught accepting luxury <sub alias="S-U-Vs">SUVs</sub> from Beijing Automotive Group, channeled through China's Pretoria embassy.</s> <s>Five vehicles went to ruling party leaders who also served as ministers, and neither filed gift disclosures for three years.</s> <s>The pattern — Chinese automakers courting African political elites through party structures — raises the question of what that access buys in procurement and policy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>President Marcos has opened talks with Beijing — a US treaty ally hedging toward China while Washington manages the Iran war.</s> <s>The Philippines isn't abandoning the American alliance, but the overture reveals how thin US credibility has stretched across the Indo-Pacific.</s> <s>The next South China Sea incident will test whether Washington can reclaim deterrent credibility while fighting on a second front.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A French court jailed the former <sub alias="CEO">CEO</sub> of cement giant Lafarge for paying six and a half million dollars to ISIS and al-Nusra Front.</s> <s>The payments went through a Syrian subsidiary to keep a cement plant running in territory controlled by armed groups — corporate profit extracted from an active war zone.</s> <s>Holcim's Lafarge unit faces fines exceeding one million euros, and asset confiscation of up to thirty million euros alongside a crimes-against-humanity probe remain pending.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nine complaints allege stalking, abuse, and coerced religious conversion at Tata Consultancy Services in Nashik, dating back to twenty twenty-two.</s> <s>Police reviewed forty <sub alias="C-C-T-V">CCTV</sub> recordings and made arrests; Tata Sons has ordered a <sub alias="C-O-O">COO</sub>-led investigation.</s> <s>Whether the company faces corporate liability — not just individual prosecutions — will determine if this becomes a precedent for Indian labor accountability.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Singapore's <sub alias="G-D-P">GDP</sub> contracted as the Hormuz closure removed a quarter of global seaborne oil supply, and the Monetary Authority tightened policy for the first time in four years.</s> <s>Singapore is the canary in the coal mine for import-dependent Asian economies — when energy costs double, it hits their central banks first.</s> <s>The authority's signaled a possible July tightening, in sha'Allah, if energy costs pass through into broader consumer prices.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria and Morocco moved to sign a twenty-five billion dollar gas pipeline stretching six thousand nine hundred kilometers along the African Atlantic coast.</s> <s>The pipeline will carry thirty billion cubic meters annually, routing half to Morocco and European markets — potentially reshaping West Africa's energy geography.</s> <s>Nigeria's own connection arrives last, after twenty thirty, meaning the country that supplies the gas won't benefit from it for years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Germany's Rheinmetall agreed to acquire a fifty-one percent stake in Destinus, the company behind Ukraine's Ruta cruise missile.</s> <s>The deal adds German industrial production capacity to a battlefield-proven design — if regulators clear it in the second half of twenty twenty-six, it'll be Europe's first industrial-scale cruise missile joint venture.</s> <s>This is the defense industry's shift from supplying Ukraine to co-producing with it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two decades of seizure and price data show Mexico's Jalisco cartel built methamphetamine networks that run without central leadership — even after El Mencho's killing in February.</s> <s>The cartel didn't collapse because it was never built around one person; it was built around supply chains.</s> <s>No successor's been confirmed, and analysts expect regional commanders to compete for market share rather than fight for the throne.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Drax abandoned the only industrial carbon-capture test, and with it the core assumption behind UN climate models since twenty fourteen.</s> <s>Bioenergy with carbon capture has been the return path below one point five degrees in every major projection — despite never operating at scale.</s> <s>A Princeton model now finds the technology adds carbon dioxide for thirty years before removing any, and no government has pulled it from its climate plans.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sugiama died in his bunk eight days offshore on a flag-of-convenience fishing vessel, and no state investigated.</s> <s>Distant-water fishing fleets register under flags that impose no labor law, creating legal black holes where worker deaths simply go unrecorded.</s> <s>Researchers are calling for port-state inspection rights — the idea that the harbor where a ship docks should have authority the flag state won't exercise.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Seoul built a sepsis <sub alias="A-I">AI</sub> that outperformed intensive care doctors across three clinical datasets.</s> <s>Previous models read only structured data like vital signs and lab results, but this one analyzes clinical notes — the messy, narrative reasoning doctors actually rely on.</s> <s>No hospital has deployed it yet, and regulatory clearance requires prospective trials, but the shift from pattern-matching on numbers to reading clinical judgment is significant.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google grafted memory-safe Rust code into the Pixel ten modem after Project Zero proved remote code execution was possible over the internet.</s> <s>The fix replaces the <sub alias="D-N-S">DNS</sub> parser — the component an attacker hits first — with a language that eliminates the memory corruption bugs that made the attack work.</s> <s>The Pixel ten ships with the fix first, but the library's size may limit adoption on the constrained embedded modems that run most of the world's phones.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>